      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792030564532,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "caras = 6.016\nf = 6.016 / 10.000 = 0,6016\nd = |0,6016 − 0,5| = 0,1016\nmargen = 1/√10.000 = 0,0100\n\n0,1016 > 0,0100   →   SESGADA",
